## Booking and Service Area

Services must be booked at least 24 hours in advance. There is no fixed booking window beyond that, only availability, so reach out once your guest count and venue are confirmed and we can tell you which package, and which add ons if any, actually fit your day. See our [booking timeline](/blog/timeline-for-booking-wedding-rentals/) guide for more on timing a booking well ahead of your date. Comparing quotes across several vendors is covered in full in our [how to compare wedding rental quotes](/blog/how-to-compare-wedding-rental-quotes/) guide. Deciding what an AV rental is worth against buying equipment outright is a separate question again, one we cover in more depth elsewhere. Need to change your guest count or add ons after you have already booked? Our [managing last minute wedding rental changes](/blog/managing-last-minute-wedding-rental-changes/) guide covers what is still possible inside the 24 hour minimum.

## Conclusion

The honest cost levers for a Malaga wedding's AV rental are narrower than most guides claim. Right size your package to your guest count first, since that alone can be a 360 euro difference. Treat add ons as things you choose to include, not things you negotiate away. Confirm the Granada threshold if your venue is out of province, and ask your venue about its own sound system before you request a quote from anyone. [Contact us](/contact/) to check availability and get an honest quote for your date.

## FAQs

### Can I negotiate the price of a wedding AV package?

No. MEG does not offer negotiated pricing, price matching against another vendor's quote, or a discount for a weekday or off season date. Package prices are fixed and quoted ex 21% VAT.

### Do I need a live technician for wedding sound, or can I run it myself?

The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is self run after our crew delivers, installs and tests it, and suits up to 50 guests. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a live technician throughout the event and suits up to 80 guests. Choosing Eco over Wedding when your guest count and comfort level allow it saves 360 euros.

### Does my venue already have a sound system I could use instead of renting?

Some fincas, hotels and villas around Malaga have a basic house PA. It can cover background music or a small ceremony, but it rarely includes a technician, wedding sized lighting, or wireless microphones for speeches, so confirm what your venue has before deciding what you still need to rent.

### Is there a minimum spend for weddings outside Malaga?

Within the Costa del Sol, no. For Granada and other out of province destinations, bookings need to exceed 400 euros to cover the single day logistical travel.

### Can I add or remove items from a wedding AV package to control cost?

You can add: a projector and screen, a smoke machine, extra microphones, a lectern, staging, or extra technician hours, all confirmed when you request a quote. There is no documented option to remove an included item from a package for a lower price.
